---
title: Singapore Noodles v1
description: Simple Singapore noodles, good as an accompaniment for seared salmon
source: Nigella Express <urn:isbn:9780701181840>
author: Nigella Lawson
image: https://www.nigella.com/assets/uploads/recipes/public-thumbnail/seared-salmon-with-singapore-n-56371e66b27a9.jpg
servings: 4
course: Main
locale: en_GB
prep time: 10m
cook time: 10m
difficulty: Medium
cuisine: Cantonese
